<section style="position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(111, 122, 78); min-height:640px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 72px 24px; box-sizing: border-box;"><img width="1200" height="1200" {% render 'asset-src', file: 'amun-c24af5bd12.jpg', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 50vw, 100vw' %} alt="" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 42%;"><span aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);"></span><div style="position: relative; max-width: 860px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 24px; text-align: center; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><h1 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 34px; line-height: 40px; font-weight: 400;">A Return to the Source</h1><p style="margin: -8px 0 0; font-family: 'Sentient', Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 25.2px; font-style: italic;">A blessing from the Earth, the Ancients, and the Divine.</p><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px;">AMUN was born from a belief that what we seek in modern luxury has always existed in nature.</p><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px;">Rooted in ancient Egyptian inspiration and a reverence for the land, AMUN represents a return to something fundamental: the relationship between the body, the Earth, and the ingredients that have sustained generations before us.</p><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px;">We believe nature is the ultimate luxury. Not simply for its beauty, but for its abundance, its intelligence, and its ability to support a more intentional way of living.</p><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px;">Our purpose is to bring this ancestral understanding into the present, creating a new expression of hair and skin care that honors where we come from while embracing the sophistication of modern life.</p></div><a href="/collections/all" class="atc" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 50px; min-width: 200px; padding: 0px 24px; border: 1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;">Discover More</a></div></section>
<section style="padding: 72px 24px;"><div style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0px auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 24px; text-align: center;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Welcome to AMUN</h2><p style="margin: -10px 0 0; font-family: 'Sentient', Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 25.2px; font-style: italic;">Where ancestral wisdom meets uncompromising luxury beauty.</p><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px;">At AMUN, we believe nature is the ultimate luxury, and that exceptional performance should never come at the expense of your health.</p><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px;">Rooted in ancestral wisdom, our custom-formulated, professional-grade hair and skin care harnesses the nourishing power of grass-fed tallow and nature’s finest ingredients to replenish vitality and bring hair, skin, and overall well-being back to harmony.</p><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px;">What we leave out is as intentional as what we put in. We formulate without synthetic fragrances, synthetic preservatives, or ingredients identified as hormone disruptors. We choose glass over plastic packaging to minimize the risk of microplastics entering our formulas and reduce our reliance on plastic that can pollute the Earth.</p><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px;">Every ingredient, formula, and vessel reflects one uncompromising belief: what we put on our bodies should honor our health and the earth, not work against it.</p></div></section>
